---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="国宝凪ノ城｜锦乃｜WORKS"
  description=""
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/naginocastle-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/nagino-2.png"
      alt="凪ノ城"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          NAGINO CASTLE
        </p>


        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          国宝凪ノ城
        </h1>


        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          东军进军的要冲，亦是一座巨大的岛屿。
        </p>


        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>


        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>


  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />


  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概要
      </h2>


      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        凪ノ城是使用我的世界 Java版制作的一座原创日式城郭。<br>
        它坐落于建筑RPG服务器“波鯖”的日式城镇“铁火”中心，是象征这座城镇的大型城郭作品。
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl">
    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于凪ノ城
        </h2>


        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          凪ノ城（Nagino Castle）是使用我的世界 Java版制作的一座原创日式城郭。

          在受托管理建筑RPG服务器“波鯖”内的日式城镇“铁火”时，为作为象征该区域的建筑，于城镇中心开始营建。

          <br><br>

          将曾因灾厄而毁灭的旧日式城镇所在岛屿遗址填海造陆，并在此基础上，将后来形成的新岛整体作为总构式城郭进行营建。

          它拥有这样的历史背景：奉将军家之命，作为攻陷西方武家势力、加速东军进军的军事据点而修筑。

          <br><br>

          形式为平山城。

          天守采用独立式层塔型天守，其高度仅比江户城天守低约2米，拥有极为宏大的规模。

          <br><br>

          整体外墙以红色、金色和木色作为点缀，采用具有战国城郭风格的木板外观，并以相对偏黑色的瓦片为基调。

          此外，蓝色的大棟，以及在通常会设置鯱的位置安置的龙首“青龙”装饰等，都展现出原创城郭所独有的幻想感与庄严气息。

          <br><br>

          以大坂城、名古屋城等近世城郭所具有的厚重气势为设计灵感，同时结合继承旧天守意匠的新櫓群、城门、石垣等元素，表现出独特的世界观。

          <br><br>

          初期完成的天守时光流逝视频曾以《在我的世界里建造了一座国宝级城堡。》为标题发布于YouTube Shorts，并获得超过80万次播放，引起了巨大反响。

          <br><br>

          此后，随着整座城郭规模的扩建，进行了全面重新设计，并改建为更加壮丽的“第二代天守”。

          虽然如今的面貌已经与初期天守有所不同，凪ノ城至今仍静静守望着日式城镇“铁火”的发展。

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
              <p class="text-base">凪ノ城</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式城郭</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建筑时期</p>
              <p class="text-base">2025年5月〜6月</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                建筑RPG服务器波鯖新日式城镇铁火凪ノ町本丸一丁目1番
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城年份</p>
              <p class="text-base">庆长5年（1600年）</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城者</p>
              <p class="text-base">锦乃</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">平山城</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">我的世界：Java版 v1.21.4</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类别</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式建筑・原创</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">完成</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示照片
      </h2>


      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-2.png"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-0.png"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino.jpg"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-3.png"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>



    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 返回作品一览
      </a>


      <a
        href="/zh-cn/edocastle/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        下一篇 →
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/7Zi19slunLM"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看更多视频 →
      </a>

    </div>


       <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          分享作品
        </h2>


        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <!-- X -->

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>


          <!-- Instagram -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>


          <!-- Copy -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            复制URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

</section>

<script>

  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/naginocastle/";


  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];


  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[
      Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)
    ];


  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 凪之城 | WORKS`;


  const xShare =
    document.getElementById("x-share");


  if (xShare) {

    xShare.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );

  }


  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");


  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");



  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram上分享
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制此作品页面的URL，然后<br>
            打开Instagram。
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );


    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );


    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>



<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}




.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }

}



@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }


  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }


  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}

</style>

</Layout>